text The navbar component is a responsive and versatile horizontal navigation bar with the following structure:
text navbar danger
text main
text navbar-brand danger
text left side
text always visible success
text logo
text navbar-burger the hamburger icon, which toggles the navbar menu on touch devices
text navbar-menu danger
text right side
text navbar-start the left part of the menu, which appears next to the navbar brand on desktop
text navbar-end danger
text right part
text navbar-item danger
text single item
text a danger
text div danger
text navbar-link a link as the sibling of a dropdown, with an arrow
text navbar-dropdown danger
text dropdown menu
text navbar-divider a horizontal line to separate navbar items
