h3 "Fixed navbar #"
text You can now fix the navbar to either the top or bottom of the page. This is a 2-step process:
text is-fixed-top danger
text is-fixed-bottom danger
text navbar danger
card
  text "<nav class=\"navbar is-fixed-top\">"
  button Copy success
text has-navbar-fixed-top danger
text has-navbar-fixed-bottom danger
text <html> danger
text <body> danger
card
  text "<html class=\"has-navbar-fixed-top\">"
  button Copy success
h3 Try it out!
card
  text Show bottom navbar
h3 "Dropdown menu #"
text To create a dropdown menu, you will need 4 elements:
text navbar-item with the has-dropdown modifier
text navbar-link which contains the dropdown arrow
text navbar-dropdown which can contain instances of navbar-item and navbar-divider
row
  col
    text "<nav class=\"navbar\" role=\"navigation\" aria-label=\"dropdown navigation\"> <div class=\"navbar-item has-dropdown\"> <a class=\"navbar-link\"> Docs </a> <div class=\"navbar-dropdown\"> <a class=\"navbar-item\"> Overview </a> <a class=\"navbar-item\"> Elements </a> <a class=\"navbar-item\"> Components </a> <hr class=\"navbar-divider\"> <div class=\"navbar-item\"> Version 1.0.4 </div> </div> </div> </nav>"
    button Copy success
h3 Show/hide the dropdown with either CSS or JavaScript
text The navbar-dropdown is visible on touch devices < 1024px but hidden on desktop >= 1024px . How the dropdown is displayed on desktop depends on the parent's class.
text The navbar-item with the has-dropdown modifier, has 2 additional modifiers
text is-hoverable: the dropdown will show up when hovering the parent navbar-item
text is-active: the dropdown will show up all the time
text While the CSS :hover implementation works perfectly, the is-active class is available for users who want to control the display of the dropdown with JavaScript. success
card
  text "<div class=\"navbar-item has-dropdown is-hoverable\"> <!-- navbar-link, navbar-dropdown etc. --> </div>"
  button Copy success
row
  col
    text "<nav class=\"navbar\" role=\"navigation\" aria-label=\"dropdown navigation\"> <div class=\"navbar-item has-dropdown is-hoverable\"> <a class=\"navbar-link\"> Docs </a> <div class=\"navbar-dropdown\"> <a class=\"navbar-item\"> Overview </a> <a class=\"navbar-item\"> Elements </a> <a class=\"navbar-item\"> Components </a> <hr class=\"navbar-divider\"> <div class=\"navbar-item\"> Version 1.0.4 </div> </div> </div> </nav>"
    button Copy success
card
  text "<div class=\"navbar-item has-dropdown is-active\"> <!-- navbar-link, navbar-dropdown etc. --> </div>"
  button Copy success
