h3 Dropdown divider
text You can add a navbar-divider to display a horizontal rule in a navbar-dropdown.
card
  text "<hr class=\"navbar-divider\">"
  button Copy success
h3 "Colors #"
text You can change the background color of the navbar by using one of the 9 color modifiers:
text is-primary
text is-link
text is-info
text is-success
text is-warning
text is-danger
text is-black
text is-dark
text is-light
text is-white
card
  text "<nav class=\"navbar is-primary\"> <!-- navbar brand, navbar menu... --> </nav>"
