h3 "Navbar Helper Classes #"
table Type Name Description
  Spacing | is-spaced | Sets Top and Bottom paddings with 1rem, Left and Right paddings with 2rem
  Shading | has-shadow | Adds a small amount of box-shadow around the navbar
h3 "Sass and CSS variables #"
card
  table Sass:badge CSS:badge Value:badge
    $navbar-background-colorCopy | var(--bulma-navbar-background-color)Copy | var(--bulma-scheme-main)Copy
    $navbar-box-shadow-sizeCopy | var(--bulma-navbar-box-shadow-size)Copy | 0 0.125em 0 0Copy
    $navbar-box-shadow-colorCopy | var(--bulma-navbar-box-shadow-color)Copy | var(--bulma-background)Copy
    $navbar-heightCopy | var(--bulma-navbar-height)Copy | 3.25remCopy
    $navbar-padding-verticalCopy | var(--bulma-navbar-padding-vertical)Copy | 1remCopy
    $navbar-padding-horizontalCopy | var(--bulma-navbar-padding-horizontal)Copy | 2remCopy
    $navbar-zCopy | var(--bulma-navbar-z)Copy | 30Copy
    $navbar-fixed-zCopy | var(--bulma-navbar-fixed-z)Copy | 30Copy
    $navbar-item-img-max-heightCopy | var(--bulma-navbar-item-img-max-height)Copy | 1.75remCopy
    $navbar-burger-colorCopy | var(--bulma-navbar-burger-color)Copy | var(--bulma-navbar-item-color)Copy
    $navbar-tab-hover-background-colorCopy | var(--bulma-navbar-tab-hover-background-color)Copy | transparentCopy
    $navbar-tab-hover-border-bottom-colorCopy | var(--bulma-navbar-tab-hover-border-bottom-color)Copy | var(--bulma-link)Copy
